sequenceDiagram
    actor User as "Retailer/Sales"
    participant UI as "Interface: UI"
    participant API as "mainController: Controller"
    participant App as "applicationService: Service"
    participant DB as "PostgreSQL: Database"
    User->>UI: Open loyalty balance
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/loyalty/cards/me or /{retailerId}
    API->>App: Authorize retailer ownership or Sales assignment
    App->>+DB: Read balance, earn/redeem/correction ledger
    DB-->>-App: Auditable loyalty summary
    App-->>UI: Available balance and transaction history
    Note over App,DB: Points become usable only after complete receipt, settled adjusted amount and no pending complaint.


